The trend graphs for work week 33 have been updated automatically at
https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Bug_Trend. The weighted defect
density decreased from last week's 1600 to 1559, the report of wdd over
the total number of bugs - (wdd plus) increased from 4.907 to 4.933.

Screenshots of the graphs are attached for people who need a copy while
offline. These are large images and you may need to open them outside of
your e-mail client to see all the detail.

